{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/extras/929f61a91bb965008327eb14fc4d5d84.avif?t=1769200538\" width=1438 height=233 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Squid Chess?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Squid Chess</i></strong> is a fast-paced real-time chess-based  cast'em'up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever been playing Chess, then you thought, wow, I could play this for my entire life! That's what those Squids did. You know the saying &quot;<strong>LOVE OF THE GAME</strong>&quot;? Well, those Squids loved that game TOO much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, beyond the extinction of the human race, the Squids fused themselves to the deep-sea cables lying underneath the ocean floor. They got really into the Internet in general, but mostly, they got really into those online competitive Chess games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/extras/33d69d9134e9e4d1f95aadb3e3133236.avif?t=1769200538\" width=1129 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, spending untold eons playing internet Chess carries with it some severe psychic de-buffs. Those Squids are traumatized by what they've seen. You wouldn't even believe it. I won't even do the injustice of explaining it here in this old Steam description. You'll just have to play it. Then you'll get what I mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway,  it's your turn to take on the Chess-playing Squids of the distant future. Enter the magical death-match. Calm the Nightmare. Transform the Alchemist. <i>It's all up to you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-time Chess-based game-play</i>. No more waiting for your turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four hand-crafted worlds!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+</strong> chess pieces!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+</strong> hand-crafted battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many, many magical potions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future,  Squids play Chess, and you must transform the Vile Alchemist. No, they do not play so-called 'regulation chess', they are <i>Squids</i>. The rules were made to be broken!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924670?t=1769200538","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/299ae9b5e636b5b1a56d6f3a5784e6b06b262a6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769200538","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/af973fed25fa38069d1228b3d4c2ab5036f7ebca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769200538","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/af973fed25fa38069d1228b3d4c2ab5036f7ebca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769200538","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/extras/929f61a91bb965008327eb14fc4d5d84.avif?t=1769200538\" width=1438 height=233 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Squid Chess?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Squid Chess</i></strong> is a fast-paced real-time chess-based  cast'em'up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever been playing Chess, then you thought, wow, I could play this for my entire life! That's what those Squids did. You know the saying &quot;<strong>LOVE OF THE GAME</strong>&quot;? Well, those Squids loved that game TOO much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, beyond the extinction of the human race, the Squids fused themselves to the deep-sea cables lying underneath the ocean floor. They got really into the Internet in general, but mostly, they got really into those online competitive Chess games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924670/extras/33d69d9134e9e4d1f95aadb3e3133236.avif?t=1769200538\" width=1129 height=139 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, spending untold eons playing internet Chess carries with it some severe psychic de-buffs. Those Squids are traumatized by what they've seen. You wouldn't even believe it. I won't even do the injustice of explaining it here in this old Steam description. You'll just have to play it. Then you'll get what I mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway,  it's your turn to take on the Chess-playing Squids of the distant future. Enter the magical death-match. Calm the Nightmare. Transform the Alchemist. <i>It's all up to you...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-time Chess-based game-play</i>. No more waiting for your turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four hand-crafted worlds!</stron